    "title": "Host logging disabled",
    "desc": "A program stopped, disabled or neutered a logging service - journald, rsyslog, syslog-ng, auditd, or a named EDR agent - or edited journald's config to stop storing logs. Turning off the logging the host (and banken) depend on is a deliberate, high-signal defense-evasion step (MITRE T1562.001 / T1565): an attacker blinds the host before acting. tamper_banken covers attacks on banken and auditd specifically; this covers the rest of the logging stack.",
